1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,700
This is TacticLens.

2
00:00:02,049 --> 00:00:05,390
An AI match-intelligence engine on Microsoft Azure,

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:09,189
that turns football data into stories every fan can trust.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,679
A scoreline doesn't explain a game.

5
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,867
And one commentary can't fit every fan:

6
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:18,359
analysts, casual fans, beginners, or blind fans.

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:22,000
AI can write for all of them. But AI also invents numbers.

8
00:00:22,699 --> 00:00:25,168
TacticLens simulates fictional matches,

9
00:00:25,168 --> 00:00:29,030
and trains its own expected-goals and win-probability models.

10
00:00:29,379 --> 00:00:32,450
As events stream in, the score, the match stats,

11
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,010
and the win probability all update live.

12
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:37,730
A detector finds the moments that mattered.

13
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:40,345
Each one becomes broadcast overlays,

14
00:00:40,345 --> 00:00:43,429
delivered as JSON that a graphics system can use.

15
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:48,391
Agents on Microsoft Foundry write the story of every moment,

16
00:00:48,391 --> 00:00:51,090
and every sentence cites its evidence.

17
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:54,106
The same goal reads differently for an analyst,

18
00:00:54,106 --> 00:00:58,020
and for a beginner in Hindi, with the English source right beside it.

19
00:00:58,719 --> 00:01:02,164
Blind and low-vision fans get an audio description,

20
00:01:02,164 --> 00:01:03,920
voiced by Azure AI Speech.

21
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,590
And what if that goal had never gone in?

22
00:01:10,939 --> 00:01:15,789
The engine replays the rest of the match two hundred times with that one change,

23
00:01:15,789 --> 00:01:17,850
and shows the shift in win chance.

24
00:01:18,549 --> 00:01:21,539
A verifier checks every number before a fan sees it.

25
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:24,167
Here we switch off the Explainer agent.

26
00:01:24,167 --> 00:01:27,730
The workflow retries, then falls back to a verified template.

27
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:30,590
No fan ever sees an unchecked number.

28
00:01:31,290 --> 00:01:36,171
Under the hood: Agent Framework and Microsoft Foundry run the agents,

29
00:01:36,171 --> 00:01:41,760
with Azure AI Content Safety, Speech, Translator, Cosmos DB and Container Apps.

30
00:01:42,459 --> 00:01:43,209
TacticLens.

31
00:01:43,559 --> 00:01:45,969
Every story checked. Every fan included.

32
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:08,920
[Audio description] Minute 88. Felix Norier scores for Northbridge United, and the score is now 3-2.
